# To keep the Docker image lean and secure

### IDE ###
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

### Build artifacts ###
build/
.gradle/
out/

### Git ###
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

### Documentation ###
*.md
Makefile

### Logs ###
*.log
logs/

### Secrets & Sensitive Files ###
*.env
*.env.*
.env.local
secrets/
token.txt
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks

### Tests (not needed in production image) ###
src/test/
src/integration-test/

### Scripts (not needed in container) ###
scripts/

### OS Files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

